he format definitions sit in the schema\n4:descriptions beside their fields (AGENTS §3, §6), not in the system text.\n6:## The system text, sentence by sentence against judging-v7\n74:kind, no `prior_forecast` basis and no pointer. The system text is 4,373 characters.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
